  "f7fddc81-a15f-4a2f-93dc-8a3440ced5d9"],
 " i=1,2 parity of first linear mode; j=1,2 parity of second linear mode; \
n=-1,0,1,2 power of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["r", "n"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "faeff64a-599d-401f-a449-2715354a228a"]
